{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>As he finished, etc., all the words.</b> Meaning: it did not delay nor did it come early, but it waited until he had said all the words necessary for the matter, and immediately upon his finishing it split open." "<b>And the ground split, etc., and the earth opened, etc.</b> Nor was it sufficient to say <b>and… opened</b> etc. or <b>and… split</b>; furthermore, regarding the splitting it said ״הָאֲדָמָה״ and regarding the opening <b>הָאָרֶץ.</b> Perhaps it is because there was no mouth of the earth in the place where their feet trod; therefore the ground upon which they were standing split open, and there the mouth of the earth came into being and opened. And therefore, regarding the place where they were standing, it said <b>and the ground split</b>, and regarding the mouth of the earth it said <b>and the earth opened</b> etc.:"], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:10:29.539587128Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}